<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Sept 19 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p> Japan	  31,000			Nil</p>
<p> Mexico	 25,500</p>
<p>Net sales of 59,500 tonnes were half of the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 49,400 tonnes were 44 percent below the previous week but down 37 percent from the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Japan and Mexico.</p>
</text>
